    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye OMWAMI namusu-njila Musa mbu Bulaano witsa okhulola eshia ndiitsa okhumukholela Farao; okhuba khulwa omukhono kwamaani alabalekhuula, khandi khulwa omukhono kwamaani alabeelusia mushialoshie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omulango kwakhabili kwaMusa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Nyasaye yaboolela Musa mbu Nisie YAHWEH. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ndaloleshela Aburahamu, nende Isaka, nende Yakobo, nindilanganga mbu Nyasaye Ounyalabiosi; ne khuliira lianje YAHWEH shindabamanyishila tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi ndatinyisiye indakano yanje ninabo, okhubaheelesia eshibala shiaKanaani, eshibala shiobucheniyi bwabwe, eshia balinjimwo shinga abacheni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi ndahuliile okhubinda khwabaana baIsiraeli, shinga olwa abaMisiri babakhosia emilimo emitinyu, ne nditsuliile indakano yanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako osunjile abaana baIsiraeli ori Nisie YAHWEH, ne ndalamurusia okhurula khumisiiko emisiro chiabaMisiri, nimuboholola okhurula mubunyakhani bwabwe, nimununula nende omukhono okunyiililwe, khandi nende obwilwatsii obukhongo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khandi ndalamubukula mube lihanga lianje, nasi ndalabeetsanga khwinywe Nyasaye weenywe; khandi mulamanya shinga olua endi Yahweh Nyasaye weenywe, oumurusia okhurula khumisiiko chiabaMisiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi ndalamuusia khushialo shiatsana eshiachila ndachinguula omukhono okhushiheelesia Aburahamu, nende Isaka, nende Yakobo; khandi ndalakhuheelesia iwe, shikhubeele obulaame; nisie Yahweh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Musa yaboolela abaana baIsiraeli ario; nebutswa shibamurechela Musa amarwi ta, khulwa okhukhaywa okhwisimilisia khandi khulwa okhumiinikha khwemilimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana OMWAMI nasunjila Musa ari ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yinjila osungane nende Farao omuruchi waMisiri, mbu alekhuule abaana baIsiraeli, barule mushialoshie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Musa nasunjila OMWAMI ari Lola, abaana balsiraeli shibayambuliilekhwo ta; kho bulaano Farao alanyala arie okhumbulila, isie owomunwa okubula eshishebo ta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI nasungana nende Musa nende Haruni, nabalachilisia okhubatsiila abaana balsiraeli, khandi okhumutsiila Farao omuruchi waMisiri, okhurusia abaana balsiraeli mushialo shiaMisiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tsinzibulo tsiabakuukanyene Musa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bano nibo abakhulundu betsinzu tsiabakuuka babwe; abaana baReubeni omwana wambeli walsiraeli mbabano, mbu Hanoki, naPalu, naHezeroni, naKarami; bino nibio ebilibwa biaReubeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabaana baSimeoni mbabano, mbu Yemueli, naYamini, naOhadi, naYakhini, naZohari, naShauli omwana womukhaana omuKanaani; bino nibio ebilibwa biaSimeoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko ameera kabaana baLawi khunzibulo tsiabwe shinga olwa tsiali, mbu Gereshoni, naKohatsi, naMerari; nemiyika echia Lawi yayindila chiali eshikhumi nende amakhumi kataru namusaafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabaana baGereshoni mbabano, mbu Libini nende Shimei, ebilibwa biabwe shinga olwa biali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabaana baKohatsi mbabano mbu Aburamu, nalzihari, naHeberoni, naUzieli, nemiyika echia Kohatsi yayindila chiali eshikhumi nende amakhumi kataru nachitaru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabaana baMerari mbabano, mbu Mali nende Mushibino nibio ebilibwa biabaLawi, khunzibulo tsiabwe shinga olwa tsiali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Amuramu yaleera Yokebedi nyakhusenjenyene abe omukhasiwe; naye niyeebula Haruni nende Musa; nemiyika echia Amuramu yayindila chiali eshikhumi nende amakhumi kataru namusaafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabaana baIzihari mbabano, mbu Kora, naNefegi, naZikhiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabaana baUzieli mbabano, mbu Mishaeli, naElizafani, naSitsiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Haruni yaleera Elisheba, omukhaana waAminadabu, omukhaana wabwe Nashoni; naye niyeebula Nadabu naAbihu, Eleazari naItsamari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabaana baKora mbabano; mbu Asiri, naElekana, naAbiasafu; bino nibio ebilibwa biabaKora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Eleazari omwana waHaruni yaleera mulala khubakhaana baPutieli; naye niyeebula Finehasi. Bano nibo abakhulundu betsinzu tsiabakuuka babwe abaLawi, ebilibwa biabwe shinga olwa biali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
